                                "example_id": "817c5829-a87f-47fa-9974-5a684df2c28a",
                                "sense_id": "b52c913b-c69c-364c-ad25-0143289d3391",
                                "text": "His chat-up techniques have to be read to be imagined—they make the crudest of Loaded-style berks seem classy—and he earns far, far too much money."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74e4c002-e5a5-497c-9c26-2c6fddb3cf65",
                                "sense_id": "b52c913b-c69c-364c-ad25-0143289d3391",
                                "text": "I don't know why they couldn't just keep it as it was! How hard is it to remember 911?\nYou mean 999...\nI mean 999!\nThat's the American one!\nYeah!\nYou berk."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
